# ---- Literature PDFs: never committed ----
# The repo is PUBLIC. Publisher PDFs (including accepted manuscripts) must not be
# redistributed here. The ReferencePaper/ tree structure and its README are tracked;
# the PDFs themselves stay local. See PAPERS_TO_DOWNLOAD.md to rebuild the library.
*.pdf
ReferencePaper/**/*.pdf

